'''''Ctenidium molluscum''''' is a species of [[moss]] belonging to the family [[Hypnaceae]].<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Ctenidium molluscum Mitten, 1869 |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2682534 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=10 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

It is native to Eurasia and Northern America.<ref name="GBIF">{{cite web |title=Ctenidium molluscum Mitten, 1869 |url=https://www.gbif.org/species/2682534 |website=www.gbif.org |access-date=10 February 2021 |language=en}}</ref>

